## Queue-claim latency

- Queue write path (create→verified receipt, --verify): ~0.2 s/row (3/3 rows).
- True seat-claim latency: NOT OBSERVED BY DESIGN. Rows were created cold
  (--no-nudge, synthetic destinations matching no live seat) so no live
  seat was nudged or disturbed; no seat claims them (nextBackstop:
  queue-stuck-sweep:unclaimed, 1h — rows closed at ~04 min age, sweep never
  fired). Claiming them from outside a seat env would misattribute
  ownership, so no claim was attempted. Per REQ-F2 scenario this metric is
  recorded as unobservable-with-reason rather than invented.

