## First-degrading metric

**None degraded in this run.** Observed ranges: queue reads 0.29–0.40 s,
ps snapshots 0.36–0.63 s, create→receipt ~0.2 s, overdue 0.26 s,
self-test 53.9 s pass; all rc=0, zero variance across samples, daemon
